<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-First Enterprise cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-First Enterprise cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>--ABN-AMRO Chicago Corp analyst Jackson Spears said he cut First Enterprise Financial Group Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>--Shares in the auto finance company were off 2 to 10-1/4.</p>
<p>--&quot;We believe the Mercury situation is causing audit firms to take a much harder position with automobile finance companies,&quot; Spears said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
